e=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.edges.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(from)?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(to) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getVertices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.vertices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getEdgeCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.edges.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neighbors.size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种表示方式的性能对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>邻接矩阵</th>\n<th>邻接表</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(V²)</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>稀疏图中邻接表远优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询 (u,v) 是否有边</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(degree(u))</td>\n<td>矩阵直接索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遍历 u 的所有邻居</td>\n<td>O(V)</td>\n<td>O(degree(u))</td>\n<td>邻接表只访问实际邻居</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加顶点</td>\n<td>O(V)（需扩展矩阵）</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>邻接表动态扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加边</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>两者等效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除顶点</td>\n<td>O(V)</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>均需清理相关边</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"度与度分布\">度与度分布</h2><p>度（Degree）是图论中最基本的顶点属性。无向图中，顶点的度等于与其相连的边数。有向图中，区分入度（In-Degree，指向该顶点的边数）和出度（Out-Degree，从该顶点出发的边数）。</p>\n<p>度分布 P(k) 描述了网络中度为 k 的顶点所占比例。度分布是区分不同类型网络的关键特征。随机网络（Erdős–Rényi 模型）的度分布近似正态分布，大多数顶点的度接近平均值。真实世界的网络（如互联网、社交网络）通常遵循幂律分布 P(k) ~ k^(-γ)，少数顶点有极高的度（Hub 节点），大多数顶点度很低。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 度分布类型&#10;    A[均匀分布] --&gt; D[所有节点度相似]&#10;    B[正态分布] --&gt; E[大部分节点度接近均值]&#10;    C[幂律分布] --&gt; F[少数 Hub + 大量低度节点]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 网络类型&#10;    D --&gt; G[规则格子网络]&#10;    E --&gt; H[随机网络]&#10;    F --&gt; I[无标度网络]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph 度分布类型\n    A[均匀分布] --&gt; D[所有节点度相似]\n    B[正态分布] --&gt; E[大部分节点度接近均值]\n    C[幂律分布] --&gt; F[少数 Hub + 大量低度节点]\n  end\n  subgraph 网络类型\n    D --&gt; G[规则格子网络]\n    E --&gt; H[随机网络]\n    F --&gt; I[无标度网络]\n  end</pre><p>在软件系统中，度分析有直接的工程价值。分析微服务依赖图的入度和出度可以识别系统中的关键节点：高入度的服务是被大量依赖的基础服务（如认证服务、用户服务），其故障影响面广；高出度的服务依赖大量其他服务（如聚合网关），其可靠性受制于所有上游服务。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度的类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>高度节点的特征</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高入度</td>\n<td>被大量节点依赖</td>\n<td>基础服务、核心 API</td>\n<td>单点故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高出度</td>\n<td>依赖大量其他节点</td>\n<td>聚合服务、编排层</td>\n<td>级联故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高入度 + 高出度</td>\n<td>连接枢纽</td>\n<td>中间件、API 网关</td>\n<td>瓶颈 + 故障传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低入度 + 低出度</td>\n<td>边缘节点</td>\n<td>独立的辅助服务</td>\n<td>低风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路径与连通性\">路径与连通性</h2><p>路径是图中从一个顶点到另一个顶点的边序列。最短路径的长度定义了两个顶点之间的&quot;距离&quot;。图的直径（Diameter）是所有顶点对之间最短路径的最大值，描述了图中信息传播需要的最大步数。</p>\n<p>连通性描述了图中顶点之间的可达关系。在无向图中，如果任意两个顶点之间存在路径，图是连通的。强连通分量（Strongly Connected Component, SCC）是有向图中任意两点可以互相到达的最大子图。</p>\n<p>在微服务架构中，连通性分析揭示了系统的结构特征。如果服务依赖图不是连通的，说明系统可以被分解为完全独立的子系统。强连通分量的存在通常意味着循环依赖——这是架构设计中需要特别关注的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const findConnectedComponents = (graph: Graph&lt;unknown, unknown&gt;): string[][] =&gt; {&#10;  const visited = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;  const components: string[][] = [];&#10;&#10;  const bfs = (start: string): string[] =&gt; {&#10;    const component: string[] = [];&#10;    const queue = [start];&#10;    visited.add(start);&#10;&#10;    while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;      const current = queue.shift()!;&#10;      component.push(current);&#10;      for (const { id } of graph.getNeighbors(current)) {&#10;        if (!visited.has(id)) {&#10;          visited.add(id);&#10;          queue.push(id);&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    return component;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  for (const vertex of graph.getVertices()) {&#10;    if (!visited.has(vertex)) {&#10;      components.push(bfs(vertex));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return components;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findConnectedComponents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Graph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> visited</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> components</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bfs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [start];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      component.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNeighbors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> component;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vertex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getVertices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vertex)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      components.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vertex));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图由顶点和边组成，是描述实体关系的通用数学结构</li>\n<li>邻接矩阵适合稠密图和快速边查询，邻接表适合稀疏图和遍历操作</li>\n<li>度是顶点最基本的属性，度分布区分了随机网络和无标度网络</li>\n<li>微服务依赖图的入度/出度分析可以识别单点故障和级联故障风险</li>\n<li>连通性分析揭示系统的独立子系统和循环依赖</li>\n<li>图论为网络科学提供了精确的数学语言和算法工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图论基础","id":"图论基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图的数据结构实现","id":"图的数据结构实现"},{"level":2,"text":"度与度分布","id":"度与度分布"},{"level":2,"text":"路径与连通性","id":"路径与连通性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"图的分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics/graph-types"}}